《'''-{zh:忍者神龟;zh-hans:忍者神龟;zh-hant:忍者龜<ref name="電影譯名">{{cite web|title= 忍者龜跨過太平洋威力折半 都是星爺害的！？|work= 聯合新聞網|date= 2016-06-15 13:40|url= https://udn.com/news/story/9592/1763214|access-date= 2022-04-06|archive-date= 2021-09-23|archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20210923034325/https://udn.com/news/story/9592/1763214}}</ref>;}-'''》（{{langx|en|''Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles''}}）是一部1990年的[[美國]][[超級英雄電影]]，也是第一部《[[忍者神龟|-{zh:忍者神龟;zh-hans:忍者神龟;zh-hant:忍者龜;}-]]》原著的[[忍者龜系列|改编电影]]。

== 演員 ==
* {{link-en|茱蒂絲·豪格|Judith Hoag}}飾演 {{link-en|艾波·歐尼爾|April O'Neil}}
* {{link-en|艾理斯・寇迪|Elias Koteas}}飾演 {{link-en|凱西·瓊斯|Casey Jones (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles)}}

== 評價 ==
[[爛番茄]]根據55條評論，本片得到新鮮度42%，均分5.1／10，觀眾的好評度81%，均分4／5。<ref name="RT">{{cite web|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles_the_movie|title=Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles|work=[[爛番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]|publisher=[[Fandango Media]]|5=|access-date=1990-03-30|archive-date=2021-04-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210415031012/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles_the_movie|dead-url=no}}</ref>本片在[[Metacritic]]上根據21條評論而獲得51分<ref name="Metacritic">{{cite web|url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-1990/|title=Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles|work=[[Metacritic]]|publisher=[[CBS互動|CBS Interactive]]|5=|access-date=1990-03-30|archive-date=2024-07-11|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240711041848/https://www.metacritic.com/movie/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-1990/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

